Z||000000||86SE||02-09-2000||10:14 PM||||I have made a few.........hundred.........thousand..... but I need some more ideas.<P>Lets see, painted the main pieces surrounding the radio consol, shifter consol, speedo and tach pieces all red with a glossy finish.  I painted the dimmer switch surround, decklid release switch surround, air vents that point toward the drivers/passenger side windows, door handle surrounds all YELLOW.  Put a stiff paper insert in my 3rd brake light to say "CHUCK" in Fiero style lettering when I stop.  Painted the ash treys.  Colored my foot well lights red so it lights up my interior pink when the doors open.  Fixed the pegging temp guage.<P>And I'm workin on some lights that will come on (blink) with the bass in my cars stereo system.<P>What other mods have you guys done??  I have heard of changing the orange insert that makes your guages light up to a diffferent color, how hard is that??  I dont think i'm going to do the neon light thing.....<P>How do you go about changing the color of the seat belt nylon??  I was thinking change it from dark grey to bright yellow to match my new paint job i'll be gettin.||||reg||10
Z||000001||TOM||02-10-2000||12:11 AM||||Go to a good upholstery to get the seat belts redone with yellow webbing. It is not regular nylon webbing. I made some flush window switches. Just because I didnt like the regular ones sticking up. It is alot nicer to be able to set stuff there now||||reg||1
